  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As the sphereshaper’s ability to control the flow of magical essence throughout their body and equipment grows, they gains the ability to shape a small number of veils instantly. At 3rd level, the sphereshaper may use a move action which provokes attacks of opportunity once per day to unshape one of their existing veils and instantly reshape the released energy into a new veil. The veil that they shape using this ability cannot be bound to a chakra until they have spent one hour in meditation, even if the veil replaced this way was already bound. The sphereshaper can use this ability one additional time per day for every four levels beyond 3rd. Each time they gains an additional use of this ability, the number of veils that they can reshape with a single use of this ability increases by one (for example, at 11th level the sphereshaper can reshape up to three veils each time they use this ability).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/sphereshaper#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
